  "eval set: 1054 coins from this machine's recorder (726 train / 328 test), one row per coin",
  "labels: recorder outcome at 259200s (keyless proxy, labeler 0.2.0); bad = rug ∪ dead, ok = flat ∪ fade ∪ runner; unobserved dropped",
  "evidence: link features from the cached DexScreener/Jupiter token record only when it was fetched within 3600s after the row's t0 (latest such t0 per coin); rug-check features from that t0 snapshot",
  "split: by time: the latest 30% of rows by t0 (t0 ≥ 2026-10-12T21:28:23.575Z) are the held-out TEST split, fixed before tuning",
  "tuning: grid search on the train split only (the code refuses test rows); objective MCC of warning grade → bad; ties go to the simpler setting",
